    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_inferred" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual makes the conflicting trade mark’s priority date a temporal benchmark for prior-use evidence supplied to address a section 44 conflict. The date qualifies that route for addressing the conflict; it does not itself overcome the ground."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9e-01 ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether qualifies adequately captures a temporal benchmark for overcoming a conflict, rather than a qualification of the conflict itself."@en-AU ;
