    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual supports treating a place's reputation as qualifying what a geographical reference connotes about the goods or services. This is inferred: the qualification concerns the reference's connotation, not the reference in isolation."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 7.9e-01 ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether qualifies can encompass reputation shaping the connotation of a geographical reference."@en-AU ;
    tmk:extractionMethod "agent_authoring" ;
