    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual expressly connects the decision maker with assessing likely deception or confusion under section 43. The clear-satisfaction requirement concerns the decision maker's assessment, not the existence of the role, so related_to is the best available predicate."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9.5e-01 ;
    tmk:expertShouldCheck "Whether a threshold predicate is intended to cover a role's assessment rather than the legal test itself."@en-AU ;
    tmk:extractionMethod "agent_authoring" ;
    tmk:goldRecord "GR-0174" ;
