tmka:GR-0301 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
    rdfs:comment "Re-pointed on 2026-10-08 by S026: subject GC-0129 -> GC-0012 — an authored duplicate withdrawn in favour of the signed concept (ruling A1, ADR-0080 c2). The judgement and evidence are the original author's."@en-AU ;
