    tmk:authoringReasoning "The Manual identifies agreement to conditions and limitations as a circumstance that may affect whether revocation of acceptance is reasonable. This qualifies the decision to revoke without automatically precluding it."@en-AU ;
    tmk:confidence 9.2e-01 ;
