tmka:GR-0461 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
    rdfs:comment "Re-judged on 2026-10-08 by S026 under the owner's ruling D1 (review/rulings/2026-10-08-chat-ontology-review.yaml). The evidence is the original author's."@en-AU ;
