    tmk:spanEnd 359 ;
    tmk:spanStart 0 ;
    tmk:supportingText "Under section 121 a registered trade mark is infringed if the registered owner, or an authorised user of the trade mark having power to do so, has caused to be displayed on goods in respect of which the trade mark is registered a notice of prohibition, and a person who acquires the goods does or authorises an act, in the course of trade, that is prohibited." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

