    tmk:supportingText "In a partial assignment, the original owner of the trade mark retains the trade mark in respect of some of the goods and/or services in the application or registration and the assignee is assigned the trade mark in respect of the other goods and/or services in the application or registration." ;
    tmk:tier 2 .

