tmka:GR-0524 a tmk:AuthoredAssertion ;
    rdfs:comment "Re-pointed on 2026-10-08 by S026: object GC-0101 -> GC-0041 — an authored duplicate withdrawn in favour of the signed concept (ruling A1, ADR-0080 c2). The judgement and evidence are the original author's."@en-AU ;
