    tmk:spanStart 50 ;
    tmk:supportingText "Once an opponent has filed a complete notice of opposition (comprised of a notice of intention to oppose and an adequate statement of grounds and particulars) the applicant must file a notice of intention to defend if it wishes to continue with the non-use application." ;
    tmk:tier 3 .

