    tmk:authoringBasis "corpus_inferred" ;
    tmk:authoringReasoning "At examination the examiner is the delegate who accepts or rejects (Part 18), so the examiner is the decision maker there — as the owner confirmed the role summary (ruling C) and the signed records' not-labels now read as 'not a synonym', not 'not this role'."@en-AU ;
